@startuml
title MCP stdio 观测链
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Agent / MCP client" as Client
component "本地 MCP server" as Server
component "eBPF 生命周期与\nstdio payload 观测" as Ebpf
component "IPC lineage tracker" as Lineage
component "MCP session registry" as Registry
component "语义投影器" as Projector
database "SQLite" as Db
component "Web / OTEL" as Export

Client -down-> Server : pipe 或 AF_UNIX socketpair
Server -down-> Ebpf : fork / exec / fd 变化\nread(0) / write(1)
Ebpf -down-> Lineage : IPC 生命周期事实
Ebpf -down-> Registry : 已完成的 payload segment
Lineage -down-> Registry : stdio bundle 生命周期
Registry --> Registry : framing + tools/call 准入\nrequest/response 关联
Registry -down-> Projector : 已确认的 JSON-RPC 消息
Projector -down-> Db : actions / links / canonical JSON
Projector -down-> Export : action tree / spans
@enduml
